# (project-files 4579, git status/diff/stage/commit 4690-4797). A workspace admin can thus
# point a route at any directory the daemon process can read/commit. Fix (least-privilege):
#  - Introduce AGENSIS_PROJECT_ROOTS (colon-list of allowed absolute prefixes) + an
#    AGENSIS_ALLOW_PROJECT_FS opt-in (default off on the shared fly.dev backend).
#  - In gitRootOf (and the workspace-folder source in workspaceProjectFileSources), after
