#    uncomment the [[mounts]] block + set AGENSIS_UPLOAD_ROOT=/data/uploads. Caveat: a volume
#    binds to ONE machine — with min_machines_running>1 or scale-out, uploads aren't shared.
#  - Multi-machine correct: move bytes to object storage (S3/R2) and have resolveStoragePath
#    / the upload+content routes read/write via the bucket. Preferred for the shared backend.
